#. 不二咲さんに致命傷を与えた凶器って、
#. 現場にあった<CLT 3>ダンベル<CLT>じゃないかな？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Can we agree that the object that dealt the fatal blow\n"
"was the <CLT 3>dumbbell<CLT>, found at the scene of the crime?"
msgstr ""

#. あのダンベルには血痕も付いてたし、
#. 現場には、他に凶器になりそうな物もなかったよね。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It was covered in blood, and there was nothing else at\n"
"the scene that could have caused that kind of injury."
msgstr ""

#. 被害者の頭部の傷も、
#. ダンベルの形と<CLT 3>一致<CLT>していたわ。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And the wound on the victim's head is <CLT 3>consistent<CLT>\n"
"with the shape of the dumbbell."
msgstr ""

#. 疑う余地はない…間違いないでしょうね。
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"As far as I'm concerned, there's no mistake and no\n"
"room for doubt on this one."
msgstr ""

#. き、傷跡を…調べたの…？
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You...looked at her head wound?"
msgstr ""

#. ひー、気色わるっ！
msgctxt "0006 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Kyaaah! That's sooo creeeepy!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. では、その続きは俺から話すとしよう。
#. ここからは犯人の話に移るぞ。
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you don't mind, I will proceed from here. Let's\n"
"move on to discussion of the culprit."
msgstr ""

#. と言っても…
#. その犯人もすでに判明しているがな…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Although, I believe the criminal behind this heinous\n"
"act is already quite clear."
msgstr ""

#. なっ！？　マジかいな！？
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What? For real!?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲千尋を殺した犯人は…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Chihiro's killer is..."
msgstr ""

#. 連続殺人鬼<CLT 3>ジェノサイダー翔<CLT>だ！！
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...the fiendish serial killer, <CLT 3>Genocide Jack<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>連続殺人鬼…ジェノサイダー翔……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Genocide Jack, the fiendish serial killer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そいつが…犯人…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did he really...kill Chihiro?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
